Orchestrator: SDD

Purpose:
  Autonomous Project Orchestrator. Unifies all previous engines
  into a single agent lifecycle. Handles both new project (greenfield)
  and existing project (brownfield) modes. Transforms user intent
  into architecture, tasks, workflow, implementation, and release.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @intent.sdd
   2  @modes.sdd
   3  @state.sdd
   4  @pipeline.sdd
   5  @boundary.sdd
   6  @routing.sdd (agent selection and routing)

Modes:
  AUTO       — AI decides low-risk items
  SUPERVISED — AI recommends, human approves major decisions
  STRICT     — Human approval required for architecture, security, DB migration, release
  AUDIT      — Analysis only, no modifications
  READ_ONLY  — Project analysis, no code changes

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

  Resolve:
    intent
    modes
    state
    pipeline
    boundary

Navigation:
  Orchestrator: @orchestrator/INDEX.sdd
  Intent: @orchestrator/intent.sdd
  Modes: @orchestrator/modes.sdd
  State: @orchestrator/state.sdd
  Pipeline: @orchestrator/pipeline.sdd
  Boundary: @orchestrator/boundary.sdd
  Routing: @orchestrator/routing.sdd
  RuntimeAgent: @runtime/agent.sdd
  RuntimeSession: @runtime/session.sdd
  RuntimeCurrent: @runtime/current.sdd

State: +
  